{"version":1,"key":"card:274","content":{"id":274,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a880b21-35d9-4ebb-b4d4-9a18e0547a1c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"几个与原型相关的方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9029cbe2-d8a0-44e0-939b-b14eb615e1e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在创建对象时，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.create"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为对象指定一个原型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"b2b88ccf-f737-47f5-bfe6-1982d53a8695","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6675585e-3e2a-4a7b-a498-27e87ed7d83b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const person = {\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(\"Hello\");\n  },\n};\n\nconst friend = Object.create(person);\nfriend.sayHello(); // Hello","collabId":"5636cb13-e741-430c-8326-2d3ef11f8b5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"53642375-b263-4ce0-bfe3-9dccdb4bcecd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getPrototypeOf"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获得对象的原型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"bf0bbcdc-f404-4fb1-9b45-34661c93363d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b8de2398-110e-4d28-bbdd-0aca716d7d10","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(Object.getPrototypeOf(friend) === person); // true","collabId":"ef6237d9-69f6-477d-a19d-e624547ad904","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78145fad-b9b5-4f30-b398-72356c8be87e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中新增了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.setPrototypeOf"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，可以改变一个对象的原型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"9647154a-371c-41d9-a936-b6472e80bbe3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"64835222-422f-4145-9dfb-7366e595c965","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const dog = {\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(\"Woff\");\n  },\n};\n\nObject.setPrototypeOf(friend, dog);\nfriend.sayHello(); // Woff\nconsole.log(Object.getPrototypeOf(friend) === dog); // true","collabId":"bea86c49-d9fb-4ee2-bdbe-22be86884d1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1692110805587,"updateTime":1743303640422,"linkedCards":[{"id":275,"target":{"key":"card:275","type":"card","id":275},"summary":"如果重写了原型中的方法，如何访问原型中的方法。 在 ES5 中，通过 Object.getPrototypeOf(this).[method].call(this) 来访问原型 const person = { sayHello() { r...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640422}}